      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<color=#F57361>\xBB</color>  <b>Runtime API:</b> target.ApplyDamage(new
    RpgDamageInfo(16, \"Demo\", player)); player.DamageApplied += (info, applied)
    => ...; attack.UsePrimaryAttack(); character.Restore().\n<color=#F57361>\xBB</color> 
    <b>Scene workflow:</b> Select RpgCombatDemoController for the loop settings.
    MeleeNpc (RpgContactDamage) and RangedNpc (NpcRpgCombatBrain) events feed the
    log and the HUD; the player's OnDeath / OnRevived switch the status row.\n<color=#F57361>\xBB</color> 
    <b>Verification:</b> Turn Auto loop off and walk into MeleeNpc with WASD: every
    contact hit is logged with its source. Let the player die, then press Restore
    All."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
